  "sol_note": "the three cases are retained from the speedup version; each has a defensible SOL target (sol_mode_manifest.json): matmul FP32 = TF32-class MMA (MI300X XF32, decision D1), destindex INT8 = memory-only (M2, no arithmetic on the data), 1d_conv FP16 = FP16 MMA"
